ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service
Phase 2 — Admin Configuration da Bank Transfer Contract
Sigar: 1.0
Rana: 11 Oktoba 2026
Matsayi: Design-only / za a sake dubawa kafin coding
Canje-canjen da aka yi: Babu repo, database, Storage, ko production changes.
1. Manufar mataki
Wannan takarda ta fayyace yadda za a tsara Admin Settings, bank-transfer workflow, da yadda wannan zai zauna tare da Pi payment a cikin ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service. Za a iya aiwatar da software kafin a kammala CAC da Moniepoint Business Account, amma bank transfer ba zai zama mai karɓar kuɗi a aikace ba sai an tabbatar da bayanan asusu kuma an yi live verification.
Abubuwan da wannan mataki ya ƙunsa
Saitin bank destination da Admin zai iya shigarwa, ajiye a matsayin draft, nema a amince da shi, kunna ko kashe shi.
Bayanin banki ga mai amfani ta trusted API kawai.
Ƙirƙirar payment intent tare da price/config snapshot.
Gabatar da transaction reference da receipt, ba tare da ɗaukar su a matsayin tabbacin biyan kuɗi ba.
Admin manual reconciliation da immutable audit trail.
Rarrabe wannan tsarin da Pi U2A payment flow.
Ba ya ƙunsa
Ba a ƙirƙiri ko canza SQL tables/RPCs ba.
Ba a ƙara code, ba a tura deployment, ba a canza Mainnet.
Ba a saita Moniepoint credentials, bank account, ko real payment secret ba.
Ba a ƙayyade farashi na ƙarshe, refund policy, ko bank reconciliation authority ba.
2. Shawarar gine-gine
Bank transfer da Pi payment su kasance payment methods biyu masu zaman kansu, amma su yi amfani da payment-intent model guda. Request status ba ya maye gurbin payment status.
User side: shared AlbukhrPiAuth ya tabbatar da identity; UI ya kira trusted API don services, quotes, intents da submissions. Kada form ya dogara da localStorage.pi_user.
API: a ƙara dedicated dApp-service gateway/module. Kada a sake amfani da Core Project liquidity payment endpoints kai tsaye; waɗannan suna da add_liquidity semantics.
Admin side: a yi amfani da shared Admin Auth da MFA/AAL2 da role checks da ALBUKHR ya riga ya tanada. Kada a ƙirƙiri login ko MFA na biyu.
Database: request, price quote, active bank configuration, payment intents, evidence da audit events su kasance a Supabase. RLS, grants, ownership checks, unique constraints da server-side authorization su zama ɓangaren migration ɗaya.
Storage: bank receipts a private bucket; signed URL na ɗan lokaci ko server-mediated access. Kada a buɗe bucket ga jama'a.
Network: Mainnet API ya ƙayyade mainnet daga server configuration; kada browser ya zaɓi network ko ya tura wani network da zai canza ikon data. Internal Testnet QA ya kasance a rabe.
Ka'idar tsaro mai tushe
Browser bai da ikon tabbatar da bank transfer ko Pi payment. UI button, receipt image, transaction reference, txid, ko success callback ba su isa su nuna PAID ba. Backend/approved Admin workflow ne kawai ke iya canza payment zuwa confirmed bayan takamaiman tabbaci.
